{"id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-partial-logic.md","title":"三值命题矩阵的评估和语义后承","display":"df-partial-logic — 三值命题矩阵的评估和语义后承","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-partial-logic","aliases":["91-df-partial-logic","91-df-partial-satisfaction","91-df-three-valued-logic"],"display":"df-partial-logic — 三值命题矩阵的评估和语义后承","depends_on":["[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-weak-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-partial-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-partial-logic</span><span>91-df-partial-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-three-valued-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-logic — 三值命题矩阵的评估和语义后承"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf50594cf0328bc9\" href=\"?note=bf50594cf0328bc9\" title=\"91-df-weak-kleene\">91-df-weak-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\)</span> 为命题语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{prop}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{prop}}\\)</span> 由命题字母、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\)</span> 生成。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)\">\\(\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是指定值集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\)</span> 是由任意字母赋值递归保持三种运算的全部评估；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartLog},\\models_{\\mathbf M,v},\\models_{\\mathbf M}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartLog},\\models_{\\mathbf M,v},\\models_{\\mathbf M}\\)</span> 为下述记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathbf M}v(\\varphi),\\quad v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi),\\quad\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathbf M}v(\\varphi),\\quad v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi),\\quad\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\land v(\\varphi)\\in D,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathbf M}\\varphi\\coloneqq\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\,[(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;v(\\gamma)\\in D)\\to v(\\varphi)\\in D].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\land v(\\varphi)\\in D,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathbf M}\\varphi\\coloneqq\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\,[(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;v(\\gamma)\\in D)\\to v(\\varphi)\\in D].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}},\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}},\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿用仅有命题运算的矩阵直接评估任意一阶句子，遗漏原子、赋值与量词规则，现明确范围是命题片段。一阶强 Kleene 语义另在三值满足原子中给出，不能由本矩阵自动得到。\n强 Kleene 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(D=\\{\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>，合取/析取为真值序的 min/max；弱 Kleene 把未定义值传染给两种二元运算。超赋值通常不是真值函数矩阵，例如间隙句的排中式可超真，不应在旧应用表中列为同一种矩阵。</p>\n<p>来源：§16.1 的部分逻辑；第 18 章 的弱 Kleene 和超赋值区别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-weak-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"bf50594cf0328bc9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-weak-kleene]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartLog},\\models_{\\mathbf M,v},\\models_{\\mathbf M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\\quad\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathbf M}v(\\varphi),\\quad v(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi),\\quad\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=v(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathbf M}v(\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\land v(\\varphi)\\in D,\\qquad\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathbf M}\\varphi\\coloneqq\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}\\,[(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;v(\\gamma)\\in D)\\to v(\\varphi)\\in D].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{prop}},\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq v\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}.","display":true},{"tex":"D=\\{\\mathbf t\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2096,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-partial-logic]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-d